{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03560","headline":"中宗降诞日长宁公主满月侍宴应制 · 李峤","name":"中宗降诞日长宁公主满月侍宴应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"神龙见像日，仙凤养雏年。\n大火乘天正，明珠对月圆。\n作新金箧里，歌奏玉筐前。\n今日宜孙庆，还参祝寿篇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李峤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03560.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03560","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}